Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: DashboardAPI-EC maintainers
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-pip, python3-venv, postgresql, redis-server, nginx, ca-certificates, openssl, git, build-essential, dpkg-dev, npm
Description: API-driven NOC dashboard for HPE Aruba Networking EdgeConnect
 DashboardAPI-EC discovers an EdgeConnect Orchestrator, detects its API
 version and capabilities, inventories appliances, and presents the API data
 through a web dashboard.
